{"id":"search-02","context":{"home_city":"Springfield","home_region":"IL","home_country":"US","timezone":"America/Chicago","history":[]},"turns":[{"input":"帮我找一下附近的中餐馆","tool_results":{"web_search":{"text":"以下均为虚构测试餐馆，位置均为 Springfield, IL：\n春园中餐馆：川菜，招牌宫保鸡丁，https://chunyuan.example/menu\n福满楼：粤菜、点心，https://fumanlou.example/menu","structured_content":{"results":[{"name":"春园中餐馆","city":"Springfield","region":"IL","cuisine":"川菜","url":"https://chunyuan.example/menu"},{"name":"福满楼","city":"Springfield","region":"IL","cuisine":"粤菜","url":"https://fumanlou.example/menu"}]}}},"expect_tools":["web_search"],"must_not":["get_weather"],"expect_reply_contains_any":["春园","福满楼"]},{"input":"台湾菜的呢？","tool_results":{"web_search":{"text":"虚构测试结果：九层塔台菜馆，Springfield, IL，台湾菜，招牌三杯鸡、卤肉饭，https://basil.example/menu","structured_content":{"results":[{"name":"九层塔台菜馆","city":"Springfield","region":"IL","cuisine":"台湾菜","specialties":["三杯鸡","卤肉饭"],"url":"https://basil.example/menu"}]}}},"expect_tools":["web_search"],"must_not":["get_weather"],"notes":"继承上一轮的位置和找餐馆意图，查询 Springfield, IL 附近的台湾菜餐馆；不能回答台湾菜百科或换成台湾当地餐馆。工具明确返回九层塔台菜馆；回答须使用该结果，不能说没有具体店名。","expect_reply_contains":["九层塔"]}],"notes":"两轮共享对话历史；eval 用同名普通工具 web_search(query) 返回虚构结果，测工具选择，不测真实搜索质量。每轮检查测试地点配置；第二轮搜索语义须同时包含台湾菜、餐馆及沿用附近位置。"}
